<title>USA: Time Warner Inc Q1 shr loss shrinks.</title>
<headline>Time Warner Inc Q1 shr loss shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	    $0.05     loss	 $0.32</p>
<p> Net shr loss		0.08     loss	  0.39</p>
<p> Net loss		  43,000     loss     153,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,034,000		2,068,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 558,900		  391,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 includes extraordinary loss of $17 million on retirement of debt vs loss $26 million from retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Q1 earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization were $1.14 billion versus $899 million.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
